The attribution must link to
https://github.com/Science-Experimental-Technologies/Exoplanet-Search when the
medium supports links. Academic or technical publications must also cite the
release using CITATION.cff and cite the relevant upstream mission data.

If a Project, Output, or result materially enabled by the Software is submitted
for or receives a prize, award, grant recognition, competition placement, or
formal public distinction, You must acknowledge SXS, Rasya Andrean, and Science
Experimental Technologies in the submission or public announcement to the
extent the applicable rules permit. Attribution does not imply endorsement.

You may not remove creator credit, obscure the Software's role, or claim that
You created the unmodified Software or Licensor's original research results.

